OL,3,GNEWSA'He saved my baby, now I'm serving
OL,4,Ahim tea and toast'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA restaurant owner has described the
OL,7,Fmoment he realised a customer sitting
OL,8,Fat one of his tables was the doctor who
OL,9,Fhad helped save his daughter's life.
OL,11,FKray Treadwell and his partner Sacha
OL,12,FTownsend were working at their
OL,13,FBirmingham restaurant, 670 Grams, when
OL,14,Fthey noticed a familiar face among a
OL,15,Ftable of three diners.
OL,17,FThey could not quite place the man.
